      "value": "@{58c6b3cc227a56787575ebb4|full_name}: Not quite I think.\nAs I understand yours, you asked for an MOTD for a world, set by the world creator, While I'm asking for an MOTD for an instance - \n\nSay you create a new presentation room for an event, a space to specify what the event in progress is and any rules in effect.",
