      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c7b4b8e6fdbbf5e6bfeefe2|full_name}: It was a bit late when I wrote the reply. So whenever someone opens a new instance of a world there should be an option to type in some text that explains what is going on. Not the same but still a good idea. So people know what to expect and dont have to jump from instance to instance till they find something interesting.\n\nedit: iirc there was another post about custom names for an instance of a world instead of a random number. \nI think that would be even closer related to this request.",
      "viewerReactions": null
